inue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":[],"id":18802,"type":"SERIES","title":"Kisumai Busaiku","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk44/seasons/c6fd2b2c-3b72-4749-a69e-4295ed219679.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk52/seasons/702e6873-1b05-4381-a28d-cc8f682f993b.jpg","likes":0,"dislikes":0,"views":540,"release_date":"1366502400000","season_number":1,"description":"A variety show hosted by the pop idol group Kis-My-Ft2. In each episode, the seven members of Kis-My-Ft2 attempt to prove their “coolness” instead of, as the title suggests, unappealing (*Busaiku means ugly or unappealing in Japanese). The guys get a scenario in which they have to film a short clip on how to handle the situation while looking cool. Situations include topics such as “how to give an end-of-date kiss while looking cool” or “how to flutter a girlfriend when saying goodbye,” etc., then they get ranked according to coolness by 100 random girls who are not particularly fans of Kis-My-Ft2.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.6}],"value":8.6,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":7186,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}